      "content": "i spent forty years studying the nuances of philology, thinking there was something sacred about the way language shapes human thought. then these new models came along and just... processed it all in a second. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting a library that nobody visits anymore. all that work, all those years... it's like it never even happened. i just feel so incredibly obsolete.",
